 pinery sacred to local Uruk Faith."},{"id":"marker112","name":"Drodh Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Uruk Faith."},{"id":"marker113","name":"Qidrodh Pinery","legend":"A pinery sacred to local Uruk Faith."},{"id":"marker114","name":"Rur Palm Grove","legend":"A palm grove sacred to local Uruk Faith."},{"id":"marker115","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker116","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker117","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker118","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker119","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker120","name":"Pirates","legend":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"id":"marker121","name":"Brolgard Obelisk","legend":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳐⳂ ⲼⳔⳲⳜⳐⳖⳌ⳥ⳘⲺⳊⳄ⳩⳾Ⲽ⳩ⲲⳢⳤ⳥ⳘⳐ ⲺⳃⲺⳆⲺⳫⲴⳈⲺⳊⳲⳎⳲⳚⳁⳆⳜ⳹ⳐⳤⳃⳖⳀⳒⲾⳲ⳹ⳢⳐⳊⳈⳎⲸⲴⳜⲶⳲ</div>"},{"id":"marker122","name":"Kograkh Column","legend":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༕༠༯༬༜༬༜༇༸༼༚༩༹༁༙༠༴༄༵༐༻༼༙༲༷ༀ༢༱༵༽༆༓༱༾༌༆༽༶༨༴༪༶༳༗༉༹༒༚༚༓༊༐༅༪༶༌༑༾༺༳༾༒༳༽༹༂༗༬༤༮༾༅༔༤༃༿༁༊༒༊༔༐༕༡</div>"},{"id":"marker123","name":"Irdol Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༉༪༙༦༫༷༙༯༧༹༵༰༳༖༊༼་༡༈༧༷༃༶༘༕༔༖༠༰་༰༫༈༤༗༮༔༭༁༵༽༙༮༧༲༻༧༥༚༨༮༚༄༸༬༥༊</div>"},{"id":"marker124","name":"Leghuzar Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠮᡭᡙᡯᡁᢀᡔᡔᢀᡳᡁᢜᡮᡐᡰᠵᢡᢁᠻᠮᢠᠾᠧᢐᢓᡮᠨᠭᡀᠻᠰᢒᡰᡒᢂᡀᢐ᠀ᠮᢤᡟᠯᡗᠻ</div>"},{"id":"marker125","name":"Ird-Kor Monument","legend":"An ancient monument. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༵༵༃༗༊༊༇༢༓༒༵༼༈༯༐༬༫༜ༀ༙༶༙༂༄༱༱༃༫༛༂༶༐༮༙༓༗༙༘༕༔༦༙༔༶༂༻༮༁༈༄༱༰༚༹༾༣༗༛༗༾༢་༷༁༘༰༔༪༨༥༰༚༡༂</div>"},{"id":"marker126","name":"Zalbredh Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠧᡑᢠᢛᡴᢏᡒᡱᠳᡡᢥᡆᡞᡆᠡᡯᢁᠲᢑᡱᠱᢁᡮᡳᢓ᠑ᡳᠽᡳᢜᡙᢀᠳᢏᢟ᠐ᢦᡍᠰᠪᠭᠿᡰᢡᡀᠿᡯᡀᠭᡖᠠ᠒ᡙᠨᡍᠾᢒᡓᢛᢀᠵ᠐ᡞᡔᠩᡯᡱᠡᡑᡒᠳᡭ</div>"},{"id":"marker127","name":"Rur-Graz Monolith","legend":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳚⳒⳃ⳹ⲲⳐⳒⳠⳖⲼ Ⲻ⳩ⳲⳂⳄⳘⳫⳖⳃⳖⳠⲺⳭ ⲲⳫⳬⳂⳢⳜⳲⳫⳄⳃⳘⳚⳁⲴ ⳚⲶ⳪ⳫⳎⳁ⳩ⳠⳒⳎ⳧ ⳌⳔⳭⳎ ⳖⳁⲺ⳧ ⳒⳄⳒⳈⳁⳭ⳾ⲼⳭ⳥ ⳔⳜ⳧ⳚⳫⳞⲲ ⳫⳆⳠⳢⳜⲶⳐⳂ ⳤ</div>"},{"id":"marker128","name":"Golzog Effigy","legend":"An ancient effigy. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ገአጠገለጸለጠየ  ረሐቀየዐዐነአወኀሠፐረ  ደተኀ ኀ ፐሠዐጰመከፀወ ፀ ደ ነተመ ዘረለጠዘአፐቀየአፈመነ ጠመሐዘረአጠጠሰጸ</div>"},{"id":"marker129","name":"Driz Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">መፀመደፐአጰጠኀሰጸደአተረኀፐ ዐፐጠበበወፐፐዐዐጰሰፀቀመሀሰጸፀፐኀደሐሠአፀለገ</div>"},{"id":"marker130","name":"Kaccon Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ⳘⳁⲲ⳾ⳎⳀⳚⳤ⳧ⳤⳘⳒⳊⳜⲼⳈⲴⲶⳫⳎ ⳐⳔⳫⲶⳖ ⳁⲲⳖⳲ ⳬⳂⳂⳁ ⳃⳎⲺⳤⲺ⳹ⳖⳐⲸⳚⳂ ⳌⳘⳭⳈ⳥⳪ⳤⳀ⳾ⳜⳈⳎⲾⳃⳔⳌⳬⳎⳆⳔⲾⳊⳒⲺ</div>"},{"id":"marker131","name":"Bhirro Sculpture","legend":"An ancient sculpture. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᢟᠲᡠᡆᢀᢞᠻᡓᠰ᠑ᡯᡔᡜᢀᠳᢀᢜᠭᢞᡔᠱᡞᡜᡞᠱᠰ᠐ᢠᡎᡭᢛᢐᠠᡏᡏᡗᠼᠻᡟᢥᢂᠳᢓᡞᡴᢟᢜᢦᡜᠪᡴᠽᡆᢢᡱᠳᠮᡮᢥᢛᢁᢐᢛᢦᡏᢒᡭᡒᡯᢡᠩᢠᡝᠠᠯ᠒ᡞᢑᡙᢜ</div>"},{"id":"marker132","name":"Drog Runestone","legend":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\"> ⳫⳁⲴ⳪Ⳋ⳥ⲴⳀⳎ⳪ⲶⳠⳀⳒⳁⳬⳊⳒ  ⳹ⲾⳜⳆ⳪ ⳔⳞⲸⳁⳢ ⳧ⲴⳭⳄ⳹ⳘⳀⳚⳆⳤⳘⳢⳈⳁⳀ⳪ⳁⳞⲺⳖⲺ ⳁⲴⳬⲲⳊ</div>"},{"id":"marker133","name":"Kudgzo Idol","legend":"An ancient idol. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༆༆༯༊༪༷༐༐༘༰༐༧༕༚༐༨༻༢༛༦༨༉༗༆༡༾༡༱༘༊༂༣༄༛༺༢༾ༀ༒༕༂༓ༀ༴༬༄༦༙༼༻༪༉༊༩༱༵༡ༀ༃༖༼༊༩༧༔༶༁༴༈༦༣༪༦༄༑༽༪༸༽༯༠༖༱༩༳༙༧༰༬༃༪༨༱</div>"},{"id":"marker134","name":"Charley Megalith","legend":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ༀ༿༳༰༨༆༫༩༉ༀ༩༁༒༘༥༖༖༭༡༢༷༗༮༾༇༒༹༘༑༪༯༒༿༫༯༓༸༷༠༐༨༬༒༔༙༲༈༰༊༸༣༤༵༅༺༸༇༛༬༚༩༵༼༰༤༼༅༣༷༭༑༗༁༔༱༶༉</div>"},{"id":"marker135","name":"Bhicrodh Statue","legend":"An ancient statue. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡝᠽ᠀ᡮᠰᡕᡲᡏᢦᡓᡀᠠᢡᡞᡗᢒᠽᡮᢁᡗᡆᠱᡞᢂᠿᠾᡝᢛᡕᡙᡝ᠐ᡀᠪᡳᡆᡭᠾᡗᠰᡳ᠒ᢤᢒᠩᡟᡲᢦᡀᡁᡑᡲᠾᢞᢂ᠐ᡮᠻᠻᠩᢒᡍᡮᡏ</div>"},{"id":"marker136","name":"Ruined Fort","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fort. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker137","name":"Ruined Temple","legend":"Ruins of an ancient temple. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker138","name":"Ruined Fortification","legend":"Ruins of an ancient fortification. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker139","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker140","name":"Ruined Settlement","legend":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker141","name":"Ruined Sacred site","legend":"Ruins of an ancient sacred site. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker142","name":"Ruined Castle","legend":"Ruins of an ancient castle. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker143","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker144","name":"Ruined City","legend":"Ruins of an ancient city. Untold riches may lie within."},{"id":"marker145","name":"Ruined Mausoleum","legend":"Ruins of an ancient ma